    <briefdescription>
<para>Standard library–only implementation of <computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1prompt__engineering_1_1_i_prompt_compressor" kindref="compound">IPromptCompressor</ref></computeroutput>. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Dependency injection points:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para><computeroutput>setTokenEstimator(fn)</computeroutput> — swap in a proper tokeniser.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><computeroutput>setSummaryFn(fn)</computeroutput> — inject a real LLM summarisation call for the <computeroutput>SUMMARY</computeroutput> strategy; the default writes a placeholder <computeroutput>[…summary of N omitted tokens…]</computeroutput>. </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
